raw_content:
LLM generated submissions should be disallowed
&lt;p&gt;There's a lot of talk about what to do if an LLM generated article gets posted. I don't believe that there's a clear policy about whether they should be allowed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I think users posting them regularly should be banned from the site.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A notification on the submission page reminding people that LLM generated articles are not allowed here would also be a good idea.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This should reduce the amount of debate on whether the article should be flagged or commented on.&lt;/p&gt;
